  "modules": [
    {
      "textRaw": "MIME",
      "name": "mime",
      "desc": "<p><code>mime</code> 模块用于解析 MIME 类型字符串.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>源码依据: <code>runtime/api/augment/mime/Mime.kt</code>, <code>runtime/api/augment/mime/JsMime.kt</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">mime</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[@] mime",
          "name": "[@]_mime",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "mime(mimeStr)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "mime",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>mimeStr</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - MIME 类型字符串</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#jsmime\">JsMime</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>解析 MIME 字符串.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let m = mime(&#39;text/html; charset=utf-8&#39;);\nconsole.log(m.type); // text\nconsole.log(m.subtype); // html\nconsole.log(m.parameters.charset); // utf-8\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">JsMime</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "mimeStr"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[@] mime"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] raw",
          "name": "[p]_raw",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>原始 MIME 字符串.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] raw"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] type",
          "name": "[p]_type",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>主类型, 如 <code>text</code>.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] type"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] subtype",
          "name": "[p]_subtype",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>子类型, 如 <code>html</code>.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] subtype"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] mimeType",
          "name": "[p]_mimetype",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>规范化后的 MIME 类型, 包含参数.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] mimeType"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] mimeTypeRefined",
          "name": "[p]_mimetyperefined",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>仅包含主类型与子类型的 MIME 类型.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] mimeTypeRefined"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] parameters",
          "name": "[p]_parameters",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">object</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参数对象. 例如 <code>text/html; charset=utf-8</code> 的 <code>parameters.charset</code> 为 <code>utf-8</code>.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] parameters"
        }
      ],
      "type": "module",
